body: "GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/663\\n\\nDuplicate check: all-status searches for fresh init, merge fence, gitattributes, driver install, and multi-agent conflicts found the closed merge implementation pm-g5sx and repository-adoption pm-iwsj, but no open item owning default init wiring and recovery. This item extends that canonical lineage rather than replacing it."
